{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>ID Photo 是一款專為製作官方證件照而設計的智能工具，適合需要快速準備護照、簽證或身份證照片的用戶。這款 App 目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>下載，原價 US $0.99，能幫助您省去前往照相館的時間與費用。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-141.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>AI 智能裁剪與背景處理</h2>\n<p>本應用內置先進 AI 技術，可自動偵測並居中人臉，確保符合各國護照規格。透過 CleanCut 功能，只需一鍵即可移除背景，打造專業影樓級效果。編輯器提供亮度、對比度及曝光調整，並支援超過 100 個國家的證件照標準尺寸生成，包括美國 2×2 英寸護照照及 DV 抽籤照片，讓您在幾秒鐘內完成高質量證件照製作。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-133-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-134-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-135-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-136-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：ID Photo: Passport Photo</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id-photo-passport-photo/id6741071388?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:26:53.678234+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:01:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:39:40.176306+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:43.244131+00:00","content_hash":"39ac53e27d9ef7beaae4572f84100fcc5d3a108b4f01bc0c67380aa53be2c779","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}